# Wildly scaled intervals and f64 targets.
approx exp(x) in 100..120 degree 5 as f64 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx exp(x) in -30..-10 degree 5 as f64 norational nosplit noreduce list 1
approx sin(x) in -100..100 as f64 ulp 2 nosplit norational list 1
approx log(x) in 0.5..100 relative ulp 2 nosplit norational list 2
approx 1/x in 1e-20..1e-6 degree 3 as f64 norational nosplit noreduce list 1
